{"id":364,"date":"2026-08-14T03:35:49","date_gmt":"2026-08-14T03:35:49","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=364"},"modified":"2026-08-14T03:42:20","modified_gmt":"2026-08-14T03:42:20","slug":"keyboard-shortcuts-cheat-sheet","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/introduction\/keyboard-shortcuts-cheat-sheet\/","title":{"rendered":"Keyboard Shortcuts Cheat Sheet"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Keyboard Shortcuts Cheat Sheet<\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Open Publisher includes a variety of keyboard shortcuts designed to speed up your desktop publishing workflow. Mastering these hotkeys will help you navigate the canvas, manage your files, and manipulate design elements without constantly reaching for the ribbon.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">File &amp; Document Management<\/span><\/h3>\n<table width=\"834\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\">\n<tbody>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Windows \/ Linux<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>macOS<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Action<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + S<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + S<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Save document<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + O<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + O<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Open the file explorer to load a document or template<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + P<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + P<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Open the Print dialog \/ Export to PDF<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Editing &amp; Arrangement<\/span><\/h3>\n<table width=\"834\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\">\n<tbody>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Windows \/ Linux<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>macOS<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Action<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + Z<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + Z<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Undo last action<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + Y<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + Y<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Redo last undone action<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + C \/ Ctrl + X<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + C \/ Cmd + X<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Copy or Cut selected element<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + V<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + V<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Paste element onto canvas<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + Shift + V<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + Shift + V<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Paste text without formatting<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + A<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + A<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Select All<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + H<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + H<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Find &amp; Replace<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Delete \/ Backspace<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Delete<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Remove selected element from the canvas<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Arrow Keys<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Arrow Keys<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Nudge selected element by 1 pixel for precise alignment<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Shift + Arrow Keys<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Shift + Arrow Keys<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Nudge selected element by 10 pixels<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Shift + Click<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Shift + Click<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Select multiple elements at once<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + Z (in draw mode)<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + Z (in draw mode)<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Undo Drawing Stroke<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Text Formatting<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">All of these shortcuts are guarded so they only activate when you are actively editing inside a text box, preventing interference with canvas-level interactions.<\/p>\n<table width=\"834\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\">\n<tbody>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Windows \/ Linux<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>macOS<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Action<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + B<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + B<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Toggle Bold<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + I<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + I<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Toggle Italic<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + U<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + U<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Toggle Underline<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + Space<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + Space<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Clear Formatting \u2014 strips all manual formatting and resets to the default style (Segoe UI, 12px)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Shift + F3<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Shift + F3<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cycle Change Case<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + Shift + K<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + Shift + K<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Toggle Small Caps<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + Shift + +<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + Shift + +<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Toggle Superscript<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + =<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + =<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Toggle Subscript<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + Shift + &gt;<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + Shift + &gt;<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Increase font size by 1px<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + Shift + &lt;<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + Shift + &lt;<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Decrease font size by 1px<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + Z (in text box)<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + Z (in text box)<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Undo last text change (keystroke-by-keystroke granularity)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">View &amp; Navigation<\/span><\/h3>\n<table width=\"834\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\">\n<tbody>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Windows \/ Linux<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>macOS<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Action<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + Mouse Wheel<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + Mouse Wheel<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Zoom slider allows smooth, continuous zoom from 10% all the way to 500%<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Spacebar (Hold)<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Spacebar (Hold)<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Temporarily activates the Pan Tool to drag the canvas<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">F9<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">F9<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Quick Zoom (100%): Toggle between your current zoom level and 100% actual size. Pressing again returns to the previous zoom<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + Shift + L<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + Shift + L<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Whole Page View: Instantly zooms to fit the entire page in the window<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Ctrl + Shift + O<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Cmd + Shift + O<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Toggle Boundaries on\/off (show\/hide element boundary boxes)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Double-click top\/bottom 100px<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Double-click top\/bottom 100px<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Enter\/Exit Master Page<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Miscellaneous<\/span><\/h3>\n<table width=\"834\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\">\n<tbody>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Windows \/ Linux<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>macOS<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Action<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">\u2191 \u2191 \u2193 \u2193 \u2190 \u2192 \u2190 \u2192 B A<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"200\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">\u2191 \u2191 \u2193 \u2193 \u2190 \u2192 \u2190 \u2192 B A<\/span><\/td>\n<td width=\"434\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Konami Code (Easter Egg)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Keyboard Shortcuts Cheat Sheet Open Publisher includes a variety of keyboard shortcuts designed to speed up your desktop publishing workflow. Mastering these hotkeys will help you navigate the canvas, manage your files, and manipulate design elements without constantly reaching for the ribbon. File &amp; Document Management Windows \/ Linux macOS Action Ctrl + S Cmd [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":369,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[8],"class_list":["post-364","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-introduction"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/364","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=364"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/364\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":367,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/364\/revisions\/367"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/369"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=364"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.f